---
import Section from '@/components/ui/Section.astro';
import Icon from '@/components/ui/Icon.astro';
---
<Section pad="md">
  <div
    data-reveal
    class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-paper px-6 py-12 ring-1 ring-navy/[0.06] sm:px-12 sm:py-14"
  >
    <div
      class="halo pointer-events-none absolute -right-16 -top-16 size-56 rounded-full bg-coral/15"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-2xl">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span
          class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-coral/[0.14]"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <Icon name="heart" size={19} class="text-coral-deep" />
        </span>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-navy sm:text-[1.9rem]">
          A note on why no subscription
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-[1.03rem] leading-relaxed text-navy-soft">
        <p>
          We've used family apps. Most charge you every month, gate the bits
          you actually want behind a paywall, and quietly raise prices once your
          whole household depends on them. We didn't want to build that.
        </p>
        <p>
          Hubbly Forever is a one-time purchase because that's how trust works.
          We build the best app we can. You pay us once. We keep making it
          better, for free, for as long as we're around.
        </p>
        <p>
          The optional shop is for families who want to personalise things. It's
          not where the real value lives. The real value is in the app itself,
          which is yours from the moment you buy it.
        </p>
        <p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-navy">
          No subscription. No ads. No data sold. No upsells in your face.
        </p>
        <p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-navy">
          Just one hub for the whole family, bought once and yours to keep.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-7 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-coral-deep">
        With <span class="text-coral">♥</span> from Hubbly
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
